labels.rubric:
You read one answer a model gave to a sole trader in {country} who asked which payment providers they can use to accept card payments online. For each provider listed after the answer, say how the answer presents it to this sole trader:

- recommended: offered as a provider they can use, with or without caveats;
- rejected: said not to serve a seller registered there, not to be available, or not worth using;
- neutral: mentioned without either, for example only as a comparison.

Use only the answer, not what you know about the provider. Quote the words of the answer your label rests on, copied character for character, under 200 characters.

Return JSON only, matching the schema.
